<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-BT lifts ANI stake to 14.23 pct.</title>
<headline>RTRS-BT lifts ANI stake to 14.23 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Investment bank and fund manager Bankers Trust Australia Ltd said on Tuesday it had raised its stake in troubled engineering group Australian National Industries Ltd (ANI) to 14.23 percent from 13.22 percent previously.</p>
<p>Bankers Trust said it now holds 111.81 million ANI shares.</p>
<p>ANI shares closed three cents lower at A$1.21 on turnover of 1.10 million shares.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
